# Dashboard Studio Requirements

All new AgentSec dashboards must use Splunk Dashboard Studio unless a documented technical limitation requires otherwise.

Use GRID layout by default for:

- workshops
- investigations
- detection labs
- MLTK labs
- MCP
- A2A
- memory
- RAG
- control validation
- compliance

Use absolute layout only when specifically justified.

## Design System

Background: #F6F8FB
Primary text: #17202A
Secondary text: #5B6573
Primary navy: #0B1F33
Accent teal: #007F86
Success: #2E7D32
Warning: #B7791F
Critical: #C62828
Information: #3568A8
Advanced/ML: #6B46C1
Borders: #D9E0E7

Use a calm professional appearance.

Avoid:
- neon colors
- unnecessary gradients
- excessive charts
- crowded pages
- tiny text
- inconsistent panel sizes

Do not communicate severity using color alone.

Use text labels/icons with color.

